<BaseLayout title="Barcode API for Inventory & Catalog Enrichment | BarcodeNest" description="Add UPC and EAN product lookup to inventory software. Evaluate catalog coverage, plan monthly usage, and choose a paid barcode API from $9.99/month.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">For inventory software teams</div><h1>Barcode product lookup for your inventory workflow.</h1><p class="lede">Turn scanned UPC and EAN codes into structured product records. Reduce repeated product entry where BarcodeNest has the matching name, brand, quantity, or image.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-signal" href="/pricing/">Compare paid plans</a><a class="button" href="/docs/barcode-lookup/">Review the API</a></div><p>Starter: $9.99/month for 2,000 calls. Growth: $19.99/month for 5,000 calls.</p></div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow"><h2>Enrich product records during receiving and catalog setup.</h2><p>Your scanner reads the identifier; BarcodeNest looks up the product behind it. Submit a UPC-A, EAN-8, EAN-13, or GTIN-14 to the REST endpoint and map the JSON response into your inventory system. Normalize identifiers with the returned canonical GTIN so your application can compare supported barcode formats.</p><p>Use a single lookup when an operator scans an item. For imported catalog rows, the batch endpoint accepts up to 100 barcodes per request. Each matched Free result consumes one lifetime credit; each submitted paid batch item counts as one lookup unit.</p><h2>Keep inventory operations under your control.</h2><p>BarcodeNest supplies product metadata. Your application manages stock quantities, warehouse locations, orders, supplier prices, and inventory movements. Handle missing products with manual entry and review returned metadata before overwriting existing records.</p><h2>Choose a plan using lookup demand.</h2><p>Free includes 250 lifetime successful-result credits and 30 requests/minute for evaluation. Starter provides 2,000 calls/month and 300 requests/minute for a smaller integration. Growth provides 5,000 calls/month and 1,200 requests/minute when you need more volume or larger bursts. Paid usage counts single lookup attempts and submitted batch barcodes, including missing products. Free usage counts matched results individually.</p><h2>Validate your catalog before paying.</h2><ol><li>Choose representative barcodes from your actual suppliers and markets.</li><li>Use the Free plan to measure matches and completeness of fields your workflow requires.</li><li>Estimate monthly imports and scans, including retries and missing products.</li><li>Choose the paid allowance that fits, then upgrade from Billing in your account.</li></ol><p>Coverage varies by product and market. Images and other attributes are available only where indexed. Review <a href="/data/">data sources and coverage</a> and <a href="/terms/">data-use terms</a> before integrating.</p><h2>Need catalog enrichment instead?</h2><p>See the <a href="/product-data-api/">product data API integration guide</a> for field mapping, missing records, and batch imports.</p></div></section>
  <section class="cta-band"><div class="container cta-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Plan your integration</div><h2>Match your lookup volume to a paid plan.</h2></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-signal" href="/pricing/">See pricing and allowances</a><a class="button" href="/register/">Evaluate coverage free</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
